      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Layer 5: Enterprise Console UX\n- **Dual-Pane Split-Screen:** Source Document vs Generated Output\n- **Span-Anchored Grounding:** Hover-over highlights directly in PDF AST\n- **Atomic Review:** Accept / Reject individual diffs (no prompt-looping)\n- **Audit Export:** One-click compliance memo generation",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-l4",
      "x": 200,
      "y": -80,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 160,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Layer 4: Pipeline Assembly & Choreography\n- **Composable DAG:** `op1 >> op2 >> op3` via `pipe.lib.experts.workflow`\n- **Prediction Envelope:** Preserves text, detections, severity, and audit trail\n- **Checkpointing & Determinism:** Step-level inspection and replayability",
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-l3",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 160,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Layer 3: Normative Logic & Rules Engine\n- **Lex Specialis Precedence:** Specific rules override general standards\n- **Jurisdiction & Facet Scoping:** Territory, product class, legal facet\n- **Severity Gates:** Non-stochastic blocking of unsafe / incomplete filings",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-l2",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 160,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Layer 2: Atomic Functional AI Operators\n- **Typed Micro-Actions:** `AIBasedExpert[InputModel, OutputModel]`\n- **Pydantic Validation:** Reified I/O schemas with strict JSON guarantees\n- **Single Responsibility:** Spotting, comparing, extracting, or summarizing",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-l1",
      "x": 200,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 160,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Layer 1: Deterministic Detection & Policy Registry\n- **ScopedRegistry:** Scoped detection rules tagged by authority rank\n- **PII / Privilege Masking:** `Redactor` applying offsets right-to-left\n- **Microsecond Execution:** Non-LLM deterministic guardrails",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
