      "y": 800,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 160,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "### Layer 0: Ingestion & Substrate Layer\n- **Structural Parsing:** PDF, DOCX, XLSX, Scans converted to ASTs\n- **Coordinate Tracking:** Bounding-box and character offset fidelity\n- **Multi-Modal Tables:** Preserves multi-column hierarchical headers",
      "color": "5"
